OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FIn 1989 when he was dying with
OL,7,     FAIDS, actor Ian Charleson stepped
OL,8,     Fin to play Hamlet on the London
OL,9,     Fstage. His legendary last
OL,10,     Fperformance is remembered by his
OL,11,     Fdirector and doctor.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn June 1982, 10 Peruvian pilots
OL,14,     Fflew a secret mission to
OL,15,     FArgentina, delivering jets to
OL,16,     Fsupport the South American nation
OL,17,     Fin its war against the UK over the
OL,18,     FFalkland Islands.
